{"risk":[{"p":"n","l":"名詞","zh":"風險、危險","ex":[{"en":"In order to do that, you have to take risks.","zh":"要這麼做，你需要冒險。","s":"t","id":1366,"by":"Zifre","zid":501339,"zby":"fucongcong","sp":[38,43]},{"en":"I don't want to run such a risk.","zh":"我不想冒這個險。","s":"t","id":254874,"by":"CK","zid":13953444,"zby":"jan_OkulaJu","sp":[27,31]},{"en":"One who doesn't take risks will not win.","zh":"不冒險就不會贏。","s":"t","id":728829,"by":"Martha","zid":728828,"zby":"Martha","rev":1,"sp":[21,26]}]},{"p":"v","l":"動詞","zh":"冒…的風險","ex":[{"en":"He risked losing all his fortune.","zh":"他冒著失去所有財產的危險。","s":"t","id":300762,"by":"CM","zid":2393431,"zby":"fenfang557","sp":[3,9]},{"en":"I know what you've risked.","zh":"我知道你冒了多大的風險。","s":"t","id":2376414,"by":"CK","zid":13526191,"zby":"LeviHighway","sp":[19,25]}]}]}